    {
      "type": "tweet",
      "id": "1939732761587458096",
      "url": "https://x.com/CollabS12PBB/status/1939732761587458096",
      "twitterUrl": "https://twitter.com/CollabS12PBB/status/1939732761587458096",
      "text": "Explain ko sayo ng maayos ah.\n\nHave you seen the GROWTH of Esnyr's content (series and yung mga casual vids niya)\n\nThe quality is improving exponentially. \n\nWhy? \n\nParaphrasing Mr Beast, \"Everything that we made last video is invested to the next. Sometimes even a deficit\"\n\nThe reality of a self-run, constantly improving, content creator page is habang lumalaki ang base mo, lumolobo rin gastos mo.\n\nYou constantly need to ONE UP your previous entries. \n\nMore quality, more pasabog, more manpower, more talents and more artistic ideas (and these ideas come from networking, canvassing talents and picking expert's brains).\n\nPutting it in perspective:\nKahit say natin 5M ang isang kita ng isang influencer sa isang video\n\n- Magkano manpower?\n- location?\n- costume?\n- logistics?\n\nMagkano ba talaga ang take home ni Esnyr PER video? Probably small.\n\nSi Esnyr naman kasi, nakikita mo sa video quality niya na THEY ARE CONTINUOUSLY improving. So gumagastos talaga siya - sa equipment, sa location, and yes sa networking (kasi important yan)\n\nSo yung 200K from 4th BP might be enough for Esnyr to break even kasi baka nasa deficit siya ngayon. \n\nWhy did Esnyr join PBB?\n\nThey were hoping PBB will bring the traffic they need for their content creator career to further take off. They were probably hoping na with PBB, they don't need to invest so much on marketing and networking. Perhaps, PBB's exposure should be enough to soldier on in the upcoming near future.\n\nMay point is: Hindi glimz and glam lang ang income ni Esnyr kasi, there is VERIFIABLE proof sa quality ng output niya and manpower niya na they are continuously spending for their craft. Kaya most probably maliit lang talaga kita niya.\n\nI'll end with a quote\n\n“Naisip ko din kasi na, since I have the resources naman na, which is because of the people’s support, deserve naman nila mabigyan ng high quality school content in return,” he continues. “Above all, gusto ko rin magpasaya ng mas maraming tao and makapagbigay-aliw at nostalgia hindi lamang sa isang platform kundi sa YouTube na din.”\n\nInterview by Raphael Bautista, Nylon Manila, June 17, 2022.\nhttps://t.co/1IIkBdz2KJ",
